[I] Client library for the X XTEST and RECORD extensions

[T] libXtst provides the Xlib-based client API for the XTEST and RECORD
[T] extensions. XTEST allows synthesizing input events to test the X server
[T] without user intervention, while RECORD supports recording and reporting
[T] of protocol and events.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxtst

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
